                "text": "If the spell that's copied is modal (that is, it says \"Choose one —\" or the like), the copy created by Ral's last ability will have the same mode or modes. You can't choose different ones."
            },
            {
                "date": "2019-05-03",
                "text": "The copies that Ral's last ability creates are created on the stack, so they're not \"cast.\" Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won't trigger."
            },
            {
                "date": "2019-06-14",
                "text": "If an effect copies a card rather than a spell (such as that of God-Eternal Kefnet), this doesn't cause Ral's first ability to trigger. That ability will trigger if you cast the copy, however."
            }
        ]
    },
    "startingLoyalty": 4,
    "colorIdentityOverride": [
        "BLUE",
        "RED"
    ]
}

